Required sections:
## 탐색 요약
State how many abstracts were screened and how many full texts were compared.

## 핵심 발견
Synthesize 3-5 findings across the papers. Separate common findings from disagreements or different assumptions.

## 상위 논문 비교
Use a compact markdown table: Paper | Year | Citations | Approach/Focus | Direct relevance | Limitation.
Citation count is only a supporting impact signal; never penalize a recent paper merely because it has fewer citations.

## 현재 연구질문에 대한 의미
Explain what this literature changes, supports, or leaves unresolved for the research question.

## 미해결 사항 및 후속 제안
List remaining gaps and whether another M1 search is justified.

End with one sentence saying that researcher review is required before promoting findings to approved knowledge cards.
